  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-title">About</div>
    <div class="bio-text">
      The Trade Pros is a boutique customs brokerage and trade compliance consulting firm founded by Destinee Broussard, a Licensed Customs Broker (LCB) and Certified Customs Specialist (CCS) based in Aliso Viejo, California.<br><br>
      With a deep understanding of U.S. import and export regulations, Destinee brings hands-on expertise to businesses of all sizes — from small importers navigating their first shipment to established companies seeking to strengthen their trade compliance programs. The Trade Pros combines regulatory knowledge with a practical, client-first approach to deliver results that reduce risk and control costs.<br><br>
      Whether you need help classifying goods, managing customs entries, qualifying for free trade agreement benefits, or building an internal compliance program from the ground up, The Trade Pros is the partner you can count on to get it right.
    </div>
  </div>

